    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Ysolde Harrowgate</strong> runs Harrowgate Restorations, an independent licensed restoration house in the Lower market, in her third leased body (lovely, apart from the knees). Brisk, warm and practical, she washes her hands before and after every sentence that matters.</p><p><strong>GM notes (Part 7).</strong> [SECRET] Thaw member: she prepares the lawful vessel and keeps Violet's culture. T3 (Violet: Read Green Pattern DC 12, Quickening DC 13) and T4 (Betsy: judge DC 12, Splicing DC 14 suggested, \"warm from the core\") happen at her house. The vessel is lawful (Insight DC 11: true). Takes Bones's restoration at cost after the operation.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
      "alignment": "neutral good",
