    {
      "_id": "95c97cac09db0a4b",
      "name": "GM Reference: Ysolde Harrowgate, Voice and Restoration House",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-red-yellow.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<h2>Ysolde Harrowgate, Licensed Restorer</h2><p><em>\"Nobody was ever in it. I checked three times. That's the law, and it's also manners.\"</em></p><p><strong>Body:</strong> a woman in her third leased body (a sturdy, middle-aged human body; the lease is up in spring and she pays rent on it monthly). She is fond of it and complains about the knees.</p><p><strong>Job:</strong> runs <em>Harrowgate Restorations</em>, an independent licensed restoration house in the Lower market. Restoration under contract, no guarantees. [SUGGESTED] It is the house named on Tobias Wren's referral card (Part 6, Quest 3).</p><p><strong>[SECRET] Thaw role:</strong> prepares the vessel (a lawful construct frame with no identity, grown with tissue from a seed of life) in her back room, and keeps Violet's mycelium culture in a glass case. Quill is a customer and friend who writes her boundary runes.</p><p><strong>Motivation:</strong> she restores people for a living, and thinks one person is owed a body more than most. Privately, she would like to restore someone who will remember it was done well.</p><p><strong>Voice:</strong> brisk, warm, practical, a nurse's humor. Rubs her borrowed knees. Says \"properly\" a lot. Washes her hands before and after every sentence that matters.</p><h3>Sample dialogue</h3><ul><li>[COMMON] \"Restoration's a contract, not a miracle. Sit down, you look like a claim form.\"</li><li>[COMMON] \"No, I can't do it today. Nobody does it today. Today is for paperwork.\"</li><li>[ASK] \"This body? Leased. Third one. Lovely, apart from the knees. Lease is up in spring.\"</li><li>[ASK] <em>(the vessel)</em> \"Construct material without identity. Bought, receipted, three records. Nobody was ever in it.\" (Insight DC 11: true.)</li><li>[ASK] <em>(to Betsy)</em> \"It'll arrive cold from the inside. Pick me a body that warms from the middle, not one that just survives by stopping. She's done enough stopping.\"</li><li>[EARN] \"Yes, I know whose it's for. No, I won't say it out here.\"</li><li>[EARN] <em>(Bones)</em> \"Bring me the name, the skull if you can get it, and the toe if you can't. After this is done, I'll take him at cost. No promises. There never are.\"</li><li><em>(to Lil)</em> \"Hands where I can see them, love.\" <em>(Lil: \"They're always where you can see them. That's the problem with hands.\")</em></li></ul>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
          "custom": "Varrenmoor DM Guide, Part 7 (Session 14)",
          "book": "",
          "page": "",
          "license": "",
