    {
      "_id": "dc7cf77a0988c884",
      "name": "Side Quest: A Body That Warms From the Middle",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-red-yellow.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<h2>Side Quest: A Body That Warms From the Middle (Part 7, T3 and T4)</h2><ul><li><strong>T3, the living strand (Violet):</strong> the culture is in Ysolde's glass case. Read Green Pattern (free, DC 12): cave mycelium, Vitality Strained, cold blocking growth. Quickening (1 charge) DC 13 grows a 30-ft strand (failure: 10 ft, a second Quickening finishes it). Tie Green Thread (1 charge, 10 minutes) between the case and the strand's tip: the signal. Needs Dale's Rime dose (T2) or the strand freezes in an hour.</li><li><strong>T4, the vessel's fit (Betsy):</strong> see <em>Training Reference: Choosing a Continuation</em>.</li></ul><p><strong>Reward:</strong> a Stable vessel and a calm Ysolde; Betsy gets a supervised adaptation study (no extra charges or actions). Ysolde agrees to take Bones's restoration at cost once the operation is done.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
