    {
      "_id": "5884cf972631801b",
      "name": "Lore Reference: Bones's Restoration",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-red-yellow.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<h2>Bones's Restoration</h2><p>[EARN] <em>\"Bring me the name, the skull if you can get it, and the toe if you can't. After this is done, I'll take him at cost. No promises. There never are.\"</em></p><p>She takes Bones's restoration contract <strong>at cost</strong> once the Thaw's operation is done. No guaranteed success (canon). Pringus's claim process stays separate from the restoration. If the party has Wren's stamped referral card, this is the house on the card [SUGGESTED]. If the party refuses the Thaw, she still only takes Bones on after the operation (7.10).</p>",
          "chat": ""
